/-!
# `HS` satisfies the permutation-labelling criterion

The action of `HS` (the TauCeti presented group) on 176 points, given by permutation tables of
the presentation generators: the ATLAS of Group Representations permutation representation
`HSG1-p176bB0` on standard generators. The tables are checked against the relators of the TauCeti
presentation by kernel evaluation (so the representation is a homomorphism), and the representation
is faithful because the group is simple (`CFSGOutside.Corpus.fam_sporadic_converse_tauCeti`). All
other certificates (transitivity, suborbits by colour refinement, the pairs, the Klein four-group in
the point stabilizer) are checked by kernel evaluation too.
-/

